- Mod 125: 29⁴ ≡ 31, so 29⁴⁶ = (29⁴)¹¹·29² ≡ 31¹¹·91 ≡ 81·91 ≡ 121.
- The only residue mod 1000 that is ≡ 1 (mod 8) and ≡ 121 (mod 125) is 121.

